#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/features/Usage/Subscription/FaqSubscription.tsx:48
msgid "No, there are no call duration limits. You can talk as long as you want during the selected time period."
msgstr "Tidak, tidak ada batasan durasi panggilan. Anda dapat berbicara selama yang Anda inginkan selama periode waktu yang dipilih."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/features/Usage/HoursPaymentModal/FaqHours.tsx:25
#: src/features/Usage/Subscription/FaqSubscription.tsx:59
msgid "Is this a subscription?"
msgstr "Apakah ini berlangganan?"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/features/Usage/Subscription/FaqSubscription.tsx:67
msgid "No, you are purchasing full access for a selected period of time. There is no auto-renewal, you can buy full access again when your current period ends."
msgstr "Tidak, Anda membeli akses penuh untuk periode waktu yang dipilih. Tidak ada perpanjangan otomatis, Anda dapat membeli akses penuh lagi ketika periode Anda saat ini berakhir."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/features/Usage/Subscription/FaqSubscription.tsx:78
msgid "Daily Limits?"
msgstr "Batas Harian?"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/features/Usage/Subscription/FaqSubscription.tsx:86
msgid "No, there are no daily limits. You can talk as many times as you want during the selected time period."
msgstr "Tidak, tidak ada batasan harian. Anda dapat berbicara sebanyak yang Anda inginkan selama periode waktu yang dipilih."

